      *                             YEAR VALUE: 0123456789

      **************************************************************
      *   MONTH DATA IS TWO DIGITS:  FIRST DIGIT IS 1, 2, 3, OR 4
      *     1 = 31 DAYS  2 = 30 DAYS  3 = 28 DAYS  4 = 29 DAYS;
      *     SECOND DIGIT IS THE DAY-OF-WEEK THE FIRST FALLS ON.
      *     DAY-OF-WEEK IS SUNDAY=1 THRU SATURDAY = 7
      **************************************************************

       01  MONTH-DATA.
